{
  "paper_id": "P138",
  "name": "Diffusion Policy",
  "title": "Diffusion Policy: Visuomotor Policy Learning via Action Diffusion",
  "year": 2023,
  "paper_url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.04137",
  "scope": "related_reference",
  "domain_ids": [],
  "status": "selected_core_source_sections_reviewed",
  "review": {
    "paper_id": "P138",
    "summary": "Diffusion Policy跨既有benchmark比較；Push-T的mean_score是每次rollout最高部分reward的平均，且checkpoint聚合有max與低loss選樣兩種口徑。",
    "environment": "Push-T、robomimic、Kitchen等父環境以及實機評測分開；方法repo包含多套實驗，不代表這些全是新的獨立環境資料。",
    "tasks": "Diffusion Policy學習動作序列；每個task仍追到父benchmark。Push-T是將T形物推到目標pose，圖像/lowdim兩種觀測不增語義任務。",
    "data": "Push-T Zarr含img/state/action，SequenceSampler按episode mask、horizon與padding出樣本。模型觀測image與agent_pos，action是2D推動控制目標；訓練state還含物體pose但不是全數模型可見。",
    "evaluation": "coverage=物體與目標交集/目標面積；reward=clip(coverage/.95,0,1)，done在coverage>.95。runner取每episode最高reward平均為mean_score，仍可有部分分數。multirun的max與k_min_train_loss依不同epoch選樣，需分開報；runner註記原作只聚合前n_envs的歷史差異。",
    "standardization": {
      "profile": "action_diffusion_across_existing_tasks",
      "reuse": "父task/資料source、Zarr/序列窗口、具體Push-T grader與experiment config/log。",
      "transform": "case保留觀測可見性、episode/seed、horizon/控制與圖像前處理；metric保存coverage、scaled reward、binary done和checkpoint選擇規則，不把mean_score全稱成功率。",
      "missing": "各其他父benchmark版本/資產與checker接線、原作vs修正seed集合、固定checkpoint/held-out再現和全套baseline。"
    },
    "version_note": "固定5ba07ac；README/runner已公開說明原作與修正聚合範圍。未執行原模型，未假定目前main可逐數字重現原paper。",
